---
---
<section id="contacto" class="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="contact-grid animate-on-scroll">
      <div class="contact-info">
        <h2>Contactame</h2>
        <p class="contact-desc">Cada obra comienza con un diálogo. Cuéntame sobre tu visión, el espacio que deseas transformar o la idea que quieres materializar, y diseñaremos una pieza escultórica única.</p>
        
        <div class="info-items">
          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-label">Email</span>
            <p><a href="mailto:email@gmail.com">email@gmail.com</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-label">Teléfono</span>
            <p><a href="tel:+34600000000">+34 000 000 000</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-label">Estudio</span>
            <p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Calle+del+Factor,+6,+Centro,+28013+Madrid/@40.4156264,-3.7130362,19z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0xd422879cfd1851f:0x35ccd9889b0ff21c!8m2!3d40.4156264!4d-3.7123925!16s%2Fg%2F11cnd8r1xl?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDgwNS4xIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D">Calle XXXXXX, Madrid, España</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="map">
            <iframe 
              src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d759.4235313501465!2d-3.713036230390925!3d40.41562639821499!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0xd422879cfd1851f%3A0x35ccd9889b0ff21c!2sCalle%20del%20Factor%2C%206%2C%20Centro%2C%2028013%20Madrid!5e0!3m2!1sen!2ses!4v1786390187551!5m2!1sen!2ses" width="100%" height="370" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin">
            </iframe>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      
      
      <div class="contact-form-container">
        <form class="contact-form">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="name">Nombre / Organización</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Sara" required />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="ejemplo@email.com" required />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="project">Tipo de Encargo</label>
            <select id="project" name="project">
              <option value="monumental">Escultura Monumental (Pública/Corporativa)</option>
              <option value="privado">Colección Privada</option>
              <option value="retrato">Retrato Escultórico</option>
              <option value="otro">Otro</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="message">Comunicado</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" placeholder="Descripción del encargo" required></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="send-btn">Enviar Consulta</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact {
    padding-top: 6rem;
    padding-bottom: 8rem;
  }

  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 6rem;
    align-items: stretch; /* Estira los elementos para que todos midan lo mismo */
  }

  .contact-info h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .contact-desc {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .info-items {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .info-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .info-item p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
  }

  .info-item a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .map {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .contact-form-container {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    padding: 3rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .form-group {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text-main--dark-blue);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  input, select, textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
  }

  input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .send-btn {
    padding: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    background: var(--color-bg);
    color: var(--color-text-main--dark-blue);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  button {
    width: 100%;
  }

  button:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-bg) !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .contact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }
</style>
